  "id": "section-304",
  "title": "给马××的一封信",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/3-007.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>007)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n马部长：<br>\n<br>\n　　原件奉还，此事宜速解决，要各校注意健康第一，学习第二。营养不足，宜酌增经费，学习和开会的时间宜大减。病人应有特殊待遇，全国一切学校都应如此。高教会议开过，中、小各宜开一次。以上请考虑酌办。<br>\n<br>\n<p>　　毛泽东<br>\n<br>\n　　一九五○年六月十九日</p>\n<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/3-006.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/3-008.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
